{"kind":"github_issue","repository":"microsoft/vscode-copilot-chat","item":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-chat/issues/5100","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-chat","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-chat/issues/5100/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-chat/issues/5100/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-chat/issues/5100/events","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-chat/issues/5100","id":4371080317,"node_id":"I_kwDOO5YBL88AAAABBIlkfQ","number":5100,"title":"Feature request: configurable session root / CWD for chat agent sandbox","user":{"login":"yehsuf","id":77066826,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3MDY2ODI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77066826?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yehsuf","html_url":"https://github.com/yehsuf","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yehsuf/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yehsuf/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yehsuf/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yehsuf/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yehsuf/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yehsuf/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yehsuf/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yehsuf/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yehsuf/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-05-03T06:38:11Z","updated_at":"2026-05-03T08:18:02Z","closed_at":"2026-05-03T08:18:02Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Summary\n\nAllow users to configure the working directory for a chat agent session, defaulting to the workspace root.\n\n## Motivation\n\nCurrently the sandbox sets CWD to a temporary directory (see #5097). Even after that bug is fixed, there are legitimate use cases for running an agent session rooted at a specific subdirectory — e.g. a monorepo where only one package is in scope for the session.\n\n## Proposed behavior\n\n- **Default:** CWD is the workspace root (fixing the current bug)\n- **Per-session override:** A UI affordance or slash command to set the session root at session start (e.g. `/root ./packages/my-service`)\n- **Settings fallback:** Optionally, a `chat.agent.sandbox.sessionRoot` setting for a persistent default\n\n## Why this matters\n\nTools like `git`, `npm`, `make`, and most build systems derive their context from CWD. Agents that run in the wrong directory silently produce incorrect results or fail with confusing errors.","closed_by":{"login":"yehsuf","id":77066826,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3MDY2ODI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77066826?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yehsuf","html_url":"https://github.com/yehsuf","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yehsuf/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yehsuf/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yehsuf/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yehsuf/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yehsuf/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yehsuf/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yehsuf/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yehsuf/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yehsuf/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-chat/issues/5100/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-chat/issues/5100/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null},"comments":[]}